{"id":"f76fe02e7f0cfaac","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S519Prov.md","title":"S519Prov","display":"S519Prov","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"S519Prov","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"S519Prov"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：编号入口固定参数。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>固定入口参数；其余参数沿被调用定义的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ S519Prov g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists e (and (@ Flags519 e) (@ MProv e g a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"62788ad2877d8ad2\" href=\"?note=62788ad2877d8ad2\" title=\"ZFC_Flags519\">Flags519</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c590873ab305f2e4\" href=\"?note=c590873ab305f2e4\" title=\"ZFC_MProv\">MProv</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ S519Prov g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","e